    "notes": "<p>One of the most common spacecraft anywhere: a two- to four-person crew, a dozen passengers, and high-density or high-value cargo. A stardrive is a $1,000,000 option.</p><p><em>Budget note:</em> the compartments assign 4 durability points more than the GM Guide leaves after Moderate armour is mounted. The Player's Handbook statblocks print an armour rating without charging durability for it, so this is the source as printed, not a transcription error.</p>",
